  "title": "Get Exchanges"
 },
 "description": "Reads exchange records (offer commitments) from the Boson subgraph. Filter by buyer/seller/state. Read-only. Returns: array of exchanges with offerId, state (Committed/Redeemed/Completed/Disputed/Cancelled/Revoked), and voucher details.",
